{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Linen tunic, sacred.</b> And he did not mention the ephod, the breastpiece, and the robe of the ephod, because he had already mentioned it, and it was heard — his voice in coming into the holy. And from this verse the men of the Second Temple learned, who served without Urim and Thummim; also prophets were there."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:21.462634669Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}